    "what_en": "Once installed, Claude has a local UI/UX reference library. For interface tasks, it detects product and stack, searches the library, then gives design-system, palette, typography, component, accessibility, motion advice and code.",
    "when_en": "Triggers when asked to design, build, review, or fix an interface — pages, components, accessibility, etc. Skipped for pure backend, infrastructure, or non-visual work.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Design an analytics dashboard, with a full color palette and font pairing.",
        "note": "Runs a design-system search and returns a proposal."
      },
      {
        "text": "Audit this login page for accessibility and fix the issues.",
        "note": "Checks against the UX guidelines one by one."
      },
      {
        "text": "Add a scroll animation to this list that respects reduced motion.",
        "note": "Pulls a GSAP preset and implementation notes."
      }
